     <P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2020</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>22</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日下午，数学组全体成员在家贤楼</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1314</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">教室进行了</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">学年第二学期首次线下教研会议。会议由数学学科主任、正高级特级教师虞金龙主持。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042909252853.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 29pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">本次会议主题为《聚焦学为中心，落实教学质量》，虞金龙首先传达了市属学校</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">教研组长会议的有关精神，传达了本学期学校各年级教学安排、教研活动的具体安排，并就新课程新教材使用研究、疫情期间的线上线下教学衔接等工作提出了自己的看法和建议。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042909253909.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 29pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">与会老师共同讨论并通过了学科组教研发展计划，积极践行“先研后导、自主生长”数学教学模式，抓实常规教研，提高教学质量。虞金龙要求以年级备课组为单位，把教学教研工作做细做精，着力推进本年度优质课的备赛和参评工作，发挥组内团结协作，在深入研读教材、精心设计教案、反复试教打磨的基础上，争取学校教学大比武和市属优质课评比的好成绩。</SPAN><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 29pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">会上，明确了教学安排的具体要求有：</SPAN><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">资料年段统一，创新班有所区别，一课一辅；</SPAN><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">下半年新教材的实施，校本资料的编写需要全体数学组成员的共同协作；</SPAN><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">作业布置要合理，全批全改；</SPAN><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">明确了期中考和学考的时间，安排教学。</SPAN><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; FONT-SIZE: 14.5pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042909261015.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042909261007.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">会议强调了教学研究对于促进教师成长的重要性，要求重点做好以下几个方面：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">研究新教材，推进新课程及课标的培训；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">积极参加基本功比武，争取好成绩；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">积极参与优质课及论文评比；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">加强校本培训；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">关注生涯规划，重点关注心理健康培训；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>6.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">积极参与实施精准教学、智慧课堂、信息化教学、现代化教学等工作。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">会议强调教学常规工作和研究工作需要注意的几个方面：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">课堂质量与效益的提高，重视课堂管理、课堂质量，积极跟踪课堂、听课、磨课，年青教师要多向老教师、优秀教师请教；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">加强对作业布置的研究；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">提升学科竞赛团队实力；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">关注学生，对尖子生、临界生等提前关注；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">数学班主任还要做好高一、高二学生选课的指导等。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">会议强调，对于校本教研活动备课组要充分发挥集体备课功能，定时定内容定主讲人，并详细记录；组内老师要积极参与校本课程的编写，如学考系列、高考系列等；年轻教师汇报课、青年教师研讨课、骨干教师示范课，要组内人人参与听课评课，并详细记录，积极互相探讨交流；教辅资料备课组统一，全组审核；积极申报省级学科基地、学科团队等。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042909262222.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">最后，王琛校长听取了老师们的建议和意见，对全组老师提出了教学上的具体要求和殷切希望，并同时嘱咐大家做好防护，众志成城，认真践行此次会议传达的上级精神，积极建设学科组，教学教研两手硬，共同努力创未来！</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                                                                                            </SPAN></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">供稿：韩雨珊</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><FONT face=Calibri> <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
    
